# graphify for the release image: the symbol graph tab on the curated repos
# (`just release-graphify`). `just graphify-lock` turns this into
# requirements.txt, which the Dockerfile installs with hashes required.
#
# No extras, on purpose. The LLM backends are extras (anthropic, openai,
# gemini, ollama, kimi, bedrock), so without them the image holds no model
# client at all and only the LLM-free half of graphify can run (AGENTS.md).
graphifyy==0.9.57
